Electronic Sales Report Dashboard (Task 3)

This project was developed as Task 3 during my internship at SkillInfytech IT Solutions Private Limited.

The objective of this dashboard is to analyze electronic product sales performance across regions, categories, brands, and products.

🚀 Project Overview

The dashboard provides insights into:

💰 Revenue, Total Sales & Total Customers KPIs

📈 Monthly & Yearly Sales Trend Analysis

🌍 Sales by Country & Continent

🗺 Regional Order Insights (Map Visualization)

📦 Sales by Category

🏷 Sales by Brand

🏆 Top Products by Sales

👥 Gender-Based Sales Analysis

🛠 Tools & Technologies Used

Microsoft Power BI

DAX (Measures & KPIs)

Data Modeling

KPI Cards

Interactive Filters & Visualizations

📌 Key Insights

United States generated the highest revenue.

Computers category contributed the most to overall sales.

Sales peaked during 2019 based on monthly trend analysis.

Certain brands consistently outperformed others.

